@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title State L2：可靠发送 retry 状态机
hide empty description

[*] --> CREATE_EXECUTION
CREATE_EXECUTION --> ATTEMPTING : build RetryExecution(message-send)

ATTEMPTING --> PROVIDER_SEND : attempt starts
PROVIDER_SEND --> WAIT_CONFIRM : provider.send returns future/stage
PROVIDER_SEND --> CLASSIFY : provider returns immediate ProviderSendResult

WAIT_CONFIRM --> CLASSIFY : ProviderSendResult completed
WAIT_CONFIRM --> CLASSIFY : confirmTimeout -> UNKNOWN
WAIT_CONFIRM --> CLASSIFY : Interrupted -> UNKNOWN
WAIT_CONFIRM --> CLASSIFY : ExecutionException -> mapped ProviderSendResult

CLASSIFY --> SUCCESS : CONFIRMED -> RetryDecision.SUCCESS
CLASSIFY --> BACKOFF : retryable FAILED -> RetryDecision.RETRY
CLASSIFY --> STOP_UNKNOWN : UNKNOWN + retryWhenUnknown=false
CLASSIFY --> STOP_REJECTED : REJECTED / non-retryable FAILED
CLASSIFY --> ABORTED : invalid result / abort exception

BACKOFF --> ATTEMPTING : maxAttempts/maxDuration 未耗尽
BACKOFF --> EXHAUSTED : maxAttempts 或 maxDuration 耗尽

SUCCESS --> MAP_RESULT
STOP_UNKNOWN --> MAP_RESULT
STOP_REJECTED --> MAP_RESULT
EXHAUSTED --> MAP_RESULT
ABORTED --> MAP_RESULT

MAP_RESULT --> [*] : SendResult
@enduml
